  "title": "Evotec welcomes Aurélie Dalbiez as Chief People Officer",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced the appointment of Aurélie Dalbiez as the Company’s new Chief People Officer (“CPO”), effective 15 June 2024. Aurélie will be joining Evotec’s Management Board, bringing with her a wealth of experience and expertise in Human Resources leadership.",
